---
layout: layouts/base.njk
pageTitle: "Senior Support Services in Schuylkill County, PA"
description: "Directory of elder law attorneys, estate planning, medical equipment, and senior support services in Schuylkill County, Pennsylvania."
---

<div class="container">
  {% set breadcrumbs = [{label: "Support Services"}] %}
  {% include "components/breadcrumbs.njk" %}

  <h1>Senior Support Services in Schuylkill County</h1>
  <p class="page-intro">
    Elder law attorneys, medical equipment suppliers, care managers, and community organizations that help seniors and their families navigate the challenges of aging. These providers serve the Coal Region with expertise and compassion.
  </p>

  {% set items = businesses.byCategory["support-services"].items %}
  {% for group in items | by_city %}
    <div class="city-section">
      <h2>{{ group.city }}</h2>
      <div class="card-grid">
        {% for item in group.items %}
          {% include "components/listing-card.njk" %}
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
    </div>
  {% endfor %}
</div>

<script type="application/ld+json">
{
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "ItemList",
  "name": "Senior Support Services in Schuylkill County, PA",
  "numberOfItems": {{ items.length }},
  "itemListElement": [
    {% for item in items %}
    {
      "@type": "ListItem",
      "position": {{ loop.index }},
      "url": "{{ site.url }}{{ item.url }}"
    }{% if not loop.last %},{% endif %}
    {% endfor %}
  ]
}
</script>
